---
const values = [
  {
    title: "Quality without shortcuts",
    body: "We use modern materials and proven techniques. Every restoration is finished by hand. Every consultation is unhurried.",
  },
  {
    title: "Calm, clinical, honest",
    body: "No upsells, no scare tactics. If you don't need it, we won't sell it. We'll explain anything you do, in plain English.",
  },
  {
    title: "Built around the patient",
    body: "Online booking. Evening slots. Same-day emergencies. Care that respects the fact you have a job and a life.",
  },
];
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-clinic font-semibold mb-4">About the practice</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-deep-sea leading-tight">
        Dentistry, the way it should be done.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-graphite text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Afzal Dental was built on a simple idea: deliver clinical work you'd be
        proud to do on your own family. Take the time to do it well. Make the
        experience around it gentle. Charge fairly. Be there in the evenings
        when people actually need you.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-graphite leading-relaxed">
        We're CQC-registered and GDC-regulated. Our team holds postgraduate
        qualifications in cosmetic, restorative and implant dentistry, and we
        keep learning, every year, every case.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-7 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      {values.map((v) => (
        <div class="bg-paper rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-card border border-deep-sea/5">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-deep-sea">{v.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-graphite leading-relaxed text-[15px]">{v.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
      <div class="bg-deep-sea text-paper rounded-2xl p-6 sm:col-span-2 relative overflow-hidden">
        <p class="text-mint text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-semibold">In numbers</p>
        <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-3xl">15+</p>
            <p class="text-paper/75 text-sm mt-1">years caring for patients</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-3xl">4.9★</p>
            <p class="text-paper/75 text-sm mt-1">average review rating</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-3xl">100%</p>
            <p class="text-paper/75 text-sm mt-1">CQC compliance</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
